# Keep the Docker build context clean and reproducible.
#
# The host `gartic_frontend/.dart_tool`/`build` folders are copied into the
# image by `COPY gartic_frontend/ .` and can point at the host Flutter SDK,
# making the in-container `flutter build web` use stale/mismatched package
# paths. Exclude them so every image build compiles from a clean tree.
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
.git/
.idea/
**/*.iml
